/-!
# Round six, item language (I3): the local size loop of the uniform Proposition 14

`zloopC c jZ cont`: with the descriptor registers, finds `j = Nat.size a` on `11` (`2^j` on `12`;
`zloopQ`), where `a = 32 W' P S r + w + EwH D`.  The local size bound is then `Zl = j + K D`, so
`zsz (32 W' P 2^{K D} S r) ≤ Zl` and `H + 1 < 2^{Zl}` for `H = w + EwH D` (`zl_spec`).  The field
width `G` is computed from `Zl` (not from the caller's `Z`), so the per-row factor is
`≈ log` of the size of the array and of the width bound.
-/

